{"4068300": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Dirge of the Scarlet Star", "steam_appid": 4068300, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4068300/extras/681e39a11a8164a2421ee9c1a1bb3377.avif?t=1777148632\" width=462 height=174 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4068300/extras/9ac08757a0d3ef05b3558ba388272d8c.webp?t=1777148632\" width=249 height=62 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One Morning, Afternoon, and Evening to discover how to destroy the Scarlet Star , or acquiesce to its power. Among 12 survivors players must choose one to seek the truth in a mysterious and terrifying new land filled with abominations and uncanny persons. You were brought here for a cosmic purpose what that purpose is or was is up to the player to discover or choose or believe.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4068300/extras/2be37f891c8cc31b0fe89e4b3f8950f4.poster.avif?t=1777148632\" aria-label=\"Anthony shoots his rifle\" width=100 height=100 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4068300/extras/2be37f891c8cc31b0fe89e4b3f8950f4.webm?t=1777148632\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4068300/extras/2be37f891c8cc31b0fe89e4b3f8950f4.mp4?t=1777148632\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features - 12 Playable Characters with their own distinct playstyles and side stories that may or may not merge with the main story in a kind of Holistic way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 20 Endings based off various choices</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can kill every character you meet, if you have the guts!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A morning, afternoon, and evening to stop the Scarlet Star - The world does not wait. As the day turns, characters act on agendas beyond your control</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Open Ended World - take on challenges however you see fit</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple recruitable party Members</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A Unique Art Style mixing old school pixel art with oil pastel and some watercolor.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Turn Based Strategic Combat , with dismemberment!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Original Soundtrack mostly created by our man in Japan.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4068300/extras/681e39a11a8164a2421ee9c1a1bb3377.avif?t=1777148632\" width=462 height=174 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4068300/extras/9ac08757a0d3ef05b3558ba388272d8c.webp?t=1777148632\" width=249 height=62 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One Morning, Afternoon, and Evening to discover how to destroy the Scarlet Star , or acquiesce to its power. Among 12 survivors players must choose one to seek the truth in a mysterious and terrifying new land filled with abominations and uncanny persons. You were brought here for a cosmic purpose what that purpose is or was is up to the player to discover or choose or believe.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4068300/extras/2be37f891c8cc31b0fe89e4b3f8950f4.poster.avif?t=1777148632\" aria-label=\"Anthony shoots his rifle\" width=100 height=100 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4068300/extras/2be37f891c8cc31b0fe89e4b3f8950f4.webm?t=1777148632\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4068300/extras/2be37f891c8cc31b0fe89e4b3f8950f4.mp4?t=1777148632\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features - 12 Playable Characters with their own distinct playstyles and side stories that may or may not merge with the main story in a kind of Holistic way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 20 Endings based off various choices</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can kill every character you meet, if you have the guts!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A morning, afternoon, and evening to stop the Scarlet Star - The world does not wait. As the day turns, characters act on agendas beyond your control</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Open Ended World - take on challenges however you see fit</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple recruitable party Members</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A Unique Art Style mixing old school pixel art with oil pastel and some watercolor.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Turn Based Strategic Combat , with dismemberment!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Original Soundtrack mostly created by our man in Japan.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "A JRPG and Survival Horror,featuring turn based combat and 12 different playable characters.A day, morning ,afternoon,and evening under the Scarlet Star, to end the insanity,or join it.Dirge of the Scarlet Star is a descent into isolation,madness,and a slow death under the heat of the Scarlet Star.", "supported_languages": "English", "he